Good morning,


  1.
Please see the attached snip for location of floodplain/floodway on parcel
  2.
Correct. The construction must hold up to all conditions specified in the U=
DO Section 8.4.3 (https://udo.durhamnc.gov/udo/8_04_Floodplain%20and%20Floo=
d%20Damage.htm#8.4.)
  3.
We do not permit construction in the floodway. FEMA approval involves No-Ri=
se Certification and potentially LOMR or CLOMR processes for map revision.
  4.
We do not recommend fill in the floodplain due to scouring and downstream i=
mpact and do not allow or permit it in the floodway.

Thanks,
Floodplain Managment
